<newsitem itemid="86440" id="root" date="1996-09-30" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Oasis H1 pretax up, pays first dividend.</title>
<headline>Oasis H1 pretax up, pays first dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending July 27</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		6.47		   vs 4.86</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.1		    vs nil</p>
<p> Pretax		     5.19		   vs 2.61</p>
<p> Turnover		   32.96		  vs 24.73</p>
<p> Operating result	 4.66		   vs 2.27</p>
<p> Interest receivable    0.53		   vs 0.34</p>
<p> Tax			  1.79		   vs 1.34</p>
<p> Net taxed		  3.40		   vs 1.27</p>
<p> Retained profit	  2.29		   vs 1.22</p>
<p> Pay date		   November 6</p>
<p> Div registration date  October 15</p>
<p> Ex-div date		October 7</p>
<p>Note - Oasis Stores Plc is a fashion retail chain which floated last year on the London Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Chairman Michael Bennett said in a statement that like-for-like sales growth in the first eight weeks of the second half maintained strong levels.</p>
<p>Same store sales were up 10 percent in the first half.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
